liers, two properties that housed a mushroom farm in Vale, Oregon, are for sale. Oregon Trail Mushrooms formerly operated the mushroom farm, but the farming activity has since ceased, and […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},